# Explore Skill: Downtime Distribution
## Purpose
Perform exploratory analysis on hospital equipment downtime hours.
## When to Use
During initial operational data inspection.
## Required Inputs
equipment_data.csv containing downtime_hours.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Summary statistics and histogram visualization (`summary()`, `hist()`).
## Procedure
Run code chunk in final_report.qmd.
## Validation
Verify skewness and non-negative downtime values.
## Output
Summary table and skyblue distribution histogram.
## Interpretation
Identifies whether equipment breakdowns are right-skewed or uniform.
## Limitation
Extreme outliers can disproportionately inflate the mean.